# Paths are relative to this corex_port/ directory.
# Large local-only build logs (see design spec §5) stay out of git.
build/*.log
env/*.log
# ...but keep the committed env evidence:
!env/ixsmi.log
!env/clang_version.txt
# NOTE: test/test.log MUST be committed (authoritative per-case evidence) and is
# intentionally NOT ignored here.
